  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/IMG_8664.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(190 fotos) Dissabte de nit i diumenge de vesprada s&#39;han fet al teatre M&ograve;naco les dos representacions de l&#39;obra Pitop&agrave;usics, d&#39;Eduard Costa, dirigida tamb&eacute; per Coque Serrano, amb la participaci&oacute; de 42 actors i actrius, i inclosa en la programaci&oacute; del Mar&ccedil; de la Dona preparada per l&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pitopausicsteatremarcdona100318/img_8355.jpg\" alt=\"img_8355\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pitopausicsteatremarcdona100318/img_8357.jpg\" alt=\"img_8357\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pitopausicsteatremarcdona100318/img_8358.jpg\" alt=\"img_8358\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pitopausicsteatremarcdona100318/img_8359.jpg\" alt=\"img_8359\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pitopausicsteatremarcdona100318/img_8360.jpg\" alt=\"img_8360\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pitopausicsteatremarcdona100318/img_8361.jpg\" alt=\"img_8361\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pitopausicsteatremarcdona100318/img_8362.jpg\" alt=\"img_8362\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pitopausicsteatremarcdona100318/img_8364.jpg\" alt=\"img_8364\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d